#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:4
msgid "人体姿态评估"
msgstr "Human posture assessment"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Overview"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:9
msgid "这是一个用于人体姿态评估的模型，可以检测人体的关键点，并给出人体姿态的评估结果。"
msgstr ""
"This is a model for human posture assessment that can detect key points of "
"the human body and give assessment results of human posture."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:12
msgid "输入/输出"
msgstr "input/output"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:14
msgid "输入（Input）:"
msgstr "Input:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:15
msgid "图像 （来自上游节点或工作流输入）。"
msgstr "Image (from upstream node or workflow input)."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:17
msgid "输出（Output）:"
msgstr "Output:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:18
msgid "检测到的人体框位置和置信度"
msgstr "Detected human frame location and confidence"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:19
msgid "对应关节、骨骼的颜色列表"
msgstr "Color list corresponding to joints and bones"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:20
msgid "人体姿态的评估结果"
msgstr "Human body posture assessment results"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:21
msgid "推理是否成功"
msgstr "Is the reasoning successful?"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:24
msgid "该模型只检测人体框和返回人体关键点，想要在前端大屏显示出人体姿态，需要添加一个 :ref:`关键点可视化 <关键显示>` 模块。"
msgstr ""
"This model only detects human body frames and returns human body key points."
" If you want to display the human body posture on the front-end large "
"screen, you need to add a :ref:`Key point visualization <key display>` "
"module."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:27
msgid "配置参数详解"
msgstr "Detailed explanation of configuration parameters"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:32
msgid "参数"
msgstr "parameter"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:33
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:34
msgid "示例/ ``默认值``"
msgstr "Example/``DefaultValue``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:35
msgid "节点名称"
msgstr "Node name"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:36
msgid "自定义该节点的名称，用于标识工作流中的该步骤。无需特意编辑，保持默认即可。"
msgstr ""
"Customize the name of the node to identify the step in the workflow.No "
"special editing is required, just keep the default."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:37
msgid "``human_pose_estimation_1``"
msgstr "``human_pose_estimation_1``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:38
msgid "备注"
msgstr "Remark"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:39
msgid "可选的备注信息，用于描述该步骤的用途。"
msgstr "Optional remarks describing the purpose of this step."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:40
msgid "``留空``"
msgstr "``leave blank``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:41
msgid "图像"
msgstr "image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:42
msgid "指定输入图像的来源，可以是上游节点的输出或工作流的输入参数。"
msgstr ""
"Specifies the source of the input image, which can be the output of an "
"upstream node or an input parameter of a workflow."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:43
msgid "``input image``"
msgstr "``input image``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:44
msgid "检测模式"
msgstr "detection mode"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:45
msgid "选择检测模式：wholebody（全身含手、脸、脚），body（仅身体），body_with_feet（身体含脚），hand（单手）。"
msgstr ""
"Select the detection mode: wholebody (whole body including hands, face, and "
"feet), body (body only), body_with_feet (body including feet), hand (one "
"hand)."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:46
msgid "``wholebody``"
msgstr "``wholebody``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:47
msgid "置信度阈值"
msgstr "confidence threshold"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:48
msgid "人体检测的最小置信度阈值，范围为0到1。低于该阈值的检测结果将被过滤掉。"
msgstr ""
"Minimum confidence threshold for human detection, ranging from 0 to "
"1.Detection results below this threshold will be filtered out."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/human_pose.rst:49
msgid "``0.5``"
msgstr "``0.5``"
